### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004
@servicePath = /odata/v4/employee

### 1. Test OData GET for Employees (Verify HANA Cloud Connection)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{servicePath}}/Employees
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Test OData GET for Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}{{servicePath}}/Projects
Accept: application/json

### Test 2: Call Dedicated Groq LLM Service Action
